(window.IND_GITA_V = window.IND_GITA_V || {})[9] = [{"v":1,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":"श्री भगवानुवाच","spp":"before","sa":"इदं तु ते गुह्यतमं प्रवक्ष्याम्यनसूयवे ।\nज्ञानं विज्ञानसहितं यज्ज्ञात्वा मोक्ष्यसेऽशुभात् ॥","iast":"idaṃ tu te guhyatamaṃ pravakṣyāmyanasūyave |\njñānaṃ vijñānasahitaṃ yajjñātvā mokṣyase’śubhāt ||","read":"idam tu te guhyatamam pravakshyaamyanasooyave |\njnaanam vijnaanasahitam yajjnaatvaa mokshyase'shubhaat ||","spli":"śrī bhagavānuvāca","splr":"shree bhagavaanuvaacha","en":"The Blessed Lord said: To thee, the uncarping, verily shall I declare this profoundest Secret, wisdom with knowledge combined, which, having known, thou shalt be freed from evil.","en2":"To thee, who dost not carp, verily shall I now declare this, the most profound knowledge, united with realisation, having known which, thou shalt be free from evil (Samsâra).","en2r":null,"rv":null,"kid":null},{"v":2,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"राजविद्या राजगुह्यं पवित्रमिदमुत्तमम् ।\nप्रत्यक्षावगमं धर्म्यं सुसुखं कर्तुमव्ययम् ॥","iast":"rājavidyā rājaguhyaṃ pavitramidamuttamam |\npratyakṣāvagamaṃ dharmyaṃ susukhaṃ kartumavyayam ||","read":"raajavidyaa raajaguhyam pavitramidamuttamam |\npratyakshaavagamam dharmyam susukham kartumavyayam ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Kingly Science, kingly Secret, supreme Purifier, this; intuitional, according to righteousness, very easy to perform, imperishable.","en2":"Of sciences, the highest; of profundities, the deepest; of purifiers, the supreme, is this; realisable by direct perception, endowed with (immense) merit, very easy to perform, and of an imperishable nature.","en2r":null,"rv":null,"kid":null},{"v":3,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"अश्रद्दधानाः पुरुषा धर्मस्यास्य परन्तप ।\nअप्राप्य मां निवर्तन्ते मृत्युसंसारवर्त्मनि ॥","iast":"aśraddadhānāḥ puruṣā dharmasyāsya parantapa |\naprāpya māṃ nivartante mṛtyusaṃsāravartmani ||","read":"ashraddadhaanaah purushaa dharmasyaasya parantapa |\napraapya maam nivartante mrityusamsaaravartmani ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Men without faith in this knowledge, O Parantapa, not reaching Me, return to the paths of this world of death.","en2":"Persons without Shraddhâ for this Dharma, return, O scorcher of foes, without attaining Me, to the path of re-birth fraught with death.","en2r":null,"rv":null,"kid":null},{"v":4,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"मया ततमिदं सर्वं जगदव्यक्तमूर्तिना ।\nमत्स्थानि सर्वभूतानि न चाहं तेष्ववस्थितः ॥","iast":"mayā tatamidaṃ sarvaṃ jagadavyaktamūrtinā |\nmatsthāni sarvabhūtāni na cāhaṃ teṣvavasthitaḥ ||","read":"mayaa tatamidam sarvam jagadavyaktamoortinaa |\nmatsthaani sarvabhootaani na chaaham teshvavasthitah ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"By Me all this world is pervaded in My unmanifested aspect; all beings have root in Me, I am not rooted in them.","en2":"All this world is pervaded by me in My unmanifested form: all beings exist in Me, but I do not dwell in them.","en2r":null,"rv":null,"kid":null},{"v":5,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"न च मत्स्थानि भूतानि पश्य मे योगमैश्वरम् ।\nभूतभृन्न च भूतस्थो ममात्मा भूतभावनः ॥","iast":"na ca matsthāni bhūtāni paśya me yogamaiśvaram |\nbhūtabhṛnna ca bhūtastho mamātmā bhūtabhāvanaḥ ||","read":"na cha matsthaani bhootaani pashya me yogamaishvaram |\nbhootabhrinna cha bhootastho mamaatmaa bhootabhaavanah ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Nor have beings root in Me; behold My sovereign Yoga! The support of beings, yet not rooted in beings, My Self their efficient cause.","en2":"Nor do beings exist in Me (in reality), behold My Divine Yoga! Bringing forth and supporting the beings, My Self does not dwell in them.","en2r":null,"rv":null,"kid":null},{"v":6,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"यथाऽऽकाशस्थितो नित्यं वायुः सर्वत्रगो महान् ।\nतथा सर्वाणि भूतानि मत्स्थानीत्युपधारय ॥","iast":"yathā’’kāśasthito nityaṃ vāyuḥ sarvatrago mahān |\ntathā sarvāṇi bhūtāni matsthānītyupadhāraya ||","read":"yathaa''kaashasthito nityam vaayuh sarvatrago mahaan |\ntathaa sarvaani bhootaani matsthaaneetyupadhaaraya ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"As the mighty air everywhere moving is rooted in the Ether, so all beings rest rooted in Me—thus know thou.","en2":"As the mighty wind, moving always everywhere, rests ever in the Akâsha, know thou, that even so do all beings rest in Me.","en2r":null,"rv":null,"kid":null},{"v":7,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"सर्वभूतानि कौन्तेय प्रकृतिं यान्ति मामिकाम् ।\nकल्पक्षये पुनस्तानि कल्पादौ विसृजाम्यहम् ॥","iast":"sarvabhūtāni kaunteya prakṛtiṃ yānti māmikām |\nkalpakṣaye punastāni kalpādau visṛjāmyaham ||","read":"sarvabhootaani kaunteya prakritim yaanti maamikaam |\nkalpakshaye punastaani kalpaadau visrijaamyaham ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"All beings, O Kaunteya, enter my lower nature at the end of a world-age; at the beginning of a world-age again I emanate them.","en2":"At the end of a Kalpa, O son of Kunti, all beings go back to My Prakriti: at the beginning of (another) Kalpa, I send them forth again.","en2r":null,"rv":null,"kid":null},{"v":8,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"प्रकृतिं स्वामवष्टभ्य विसृजामि पुनः पुनः ।\nभूतग्राममिमं कृत्स्नमवशं प्रकृतेर्वशात् ॥","iast":"prakṛtiṃ svāmavaṣṭabhya visṛjāmi punaḥ punaḥ |\nbhūtagrāmamimaṃ kṛtsnamavaśaṃ prakṛtervaśāt ||","read":"prakritim svaamavashtabhya visrijaami punah punah |\nbhootagraamamimam kritsnamavasham prakritervashaat ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Hidden in Nature, which is mine own, I emanate again and again all this multitude of beings, helpless, by the force of Nature.","en2":"Animating My Prakriti, I project again and again this whole multitude of beings, helpless under the sway of Prakriti.","en2r":null,"rv":null,"kid":null},{"v":9,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"न च मां तानि कर्माणि निबध्नन्ति धनञ्जय ।\nउदासीनवदासीनमसक्तं तेषु कर्मसु ॥","iast":"na ca māṃ tāni karmāṇi nibadhnanti dhanañjaya |\nudāsīnavadāsīnamasaktaṃ teṣu karmasu ||","read":"na cha maam taani karmaani nibadhnanti dhananjaya |\nudaaseenavadaaseenamasaktam teshu karmasu ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Nor do these works bind me, O Dhananjaya, enthroned on high unattached to actions.","en2":"These acts do not bind Me, sitting as one neutral, unattached to them, O Dhananjaya.","en2r":null,"rv":null,"kid":null},{"v":10,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"मयाऽध्यक्षेण प्रकृतिः सूयते सचराचरम् ।\nहेतुनाऽनेन कौन्तेय जगद्विपरिवर्तते ॥","iast":"mayā’dhyakṣeṇa prakṛtiḥ sūyate sacarācaram |\nhetunā’nena kaunteya jagadviparivartate ||","read":"mayaa'dhyakshena prakritih sooyate sacharaacharam |\nhetunaa'nena kaunteya jagadviparivartate ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Under Me as supervisor, Nature sends forth the moving and unmoving: because of this, O Kaunteya, the universe revolves.","en2":"By reason of My proximity, Prakriti produces all this, the moving and the unmoving; the world wheels round and round, O son of Kunti, because of this.","en2r":null,"rv":null,"kid":null},{"v":11,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"अवजानन्ति मां मूढा मानुषीं तनुमाश्रितम् ।\nपरं भावमजानन्तो मम भूतमहेश्वरम् ॥","iast":"avajānanti māṃ mūḍhā mānuṣīṃ tanumāśritam |\nparaṃ bhāvamajānanto mama bhūtamaheśvaram ||","read":"avajaananti maam moodhaa maanusheem tanumaashritam |\nparam bhaavamajaananto mama bhootamaheshvaram ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"The foolish disregard Me, when clad in human semblance, ignorant of My supreme nature, the great Lord of beings;","en2":"Unaware of My higher state, as the great Lord of beings, fools disregard Me, dwelling in the human form.","en2r":null,"rv":null,"kid":null},{"v":12,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"मोघाशा मोघकर्माणो मोघज्ञाना विचेतसः ।\nराक्षसीमासुरीं चैव प्रकृतिं मोहिनीं श्रिताः ॥","iast":"moghāśā moghakarmāṇo moghajñānā vicetasaḥ |\nrākṣasīmāsurīṃ caiva prakṛtiṃ mohinīṃ śritāḥ ||","read":"moghaashaa moghakarmaano moghajnaanaa vichetasah |\nraakshaseemaasureem chaiva prakritim mohineem shritaah ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Empty of hope, empty of deeds, empty of wisdom, senseless, partaking of the deceitful, brutal and demoniacal nature.","en2":"Of vain hopes, of vain works, of vain knowledge, and senseless, they verily are possessed of the delusive nature of Râkshasas and Asuras.","en2r":null,"rv":null,"kid":null},{"v":13,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"महात्मानस्तु मां पार्थ दैवीं प्रकृतिमाश्रिताः ।\nभजन्त्यनन्यमनसो ज्ञात्वा भूतादिमव्ययम् ॥","iast":"mahātmānastu māṃ pārtha daivīṃ prakṛtimāśritāḥ |\nbhajantyananyamanaso jñātvā bhūtādimavyayam ||","read":"mahaatmaanastu maam paartha daiveem prakritimaashritaah |\nbhajantyananyamanaso jnaatvaa bhootaadimavyayam ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Verily the Mahâtmâs, O Partha, partaking of My divine nature, worship with unwavering mind, having known Me, the imperishable source of beings.","en2":"But the great-souled ones, O son of Prithâ, possessed of the Divine Prakriti, knowing Me to be the origin of beings, and immutable, worship Me with a single mind.","en2r":null,"rv":null,"kid":null},{"v":14,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"सततं कीर्तयन्तो मां यतन्तश्च दृढव्रताः ।\nनमस्यन्तश्च मां भक्त्या नित्ययुक्ता उपासते ॥","iast":"satataṃ kīrtayanto māṃ yatantaśca dṛḍhavratāḥ |\nnamasyantaśca māṃ bhaktyā nityayuktā upāsate ||","read":"satatam keertayanto maam yatantashcha dridhavrataah |\nnamasyantashcha maam bhaktyaa nityayuktaa upaasate ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Always magnifying Me, strenuous, firm in vows, prostrating themselves before Me, they worship Me with devotion ever harmonised.","en2":"Glorifying Me always and striving with firm resolve, bowing down to Me in devotion, always steadfast, they worship Me.","en2r":null,"rv":null,"kid":null},{"v":15,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"ज्ञानयज्ञेन चाप्यन्ये यजन्तो मामुपासते ।\nएकत्वेन पृथक्त्वेन बहुधा विश्वतोमुखम् ॥","iast":"jñānayajñena cāpyanye yajanto māmupāsate |\nekatvena pṛthaktvena bahudhā viśvatomukham ||","read":"jnaanayajnena chaapyanye yajanto maamupaasate |\nekatvena prithaktvena bahudhaa vishvatomukham ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Others also, sacrificing with the sacrifice of wisdom, worship Me as the One and the Manifold everywhere present.","en2":"Others, too, sacrificing by the Yajna of knowledge ( i.e. , seeing the Self in all), worship Me the All-Formed, as one, as distinct, as manifold.","en2r":null,"rv":null,"kid":null},{"v":16,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"अहं क्रतुरहं यज्ञः स्वधाऽहमहमौषधम् ।\nमंत्रोऽहमहमेवाज्यमहमग्निरहं हुतम् ॥","iast":"ahaṃ kraturahaṃ yajñaḥ svadhā’hamahamauṣadham |\nmaṃtro’hamahamevājyamahamagnirahaṃ hutam ||","read":"aham kraturaham yajnah svadhaa'hamahamaushadham |\nmamtro'hamahamevaajyamahamagniraham hutam ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"I the ablation; I the sacrifice; I the ancestral offering; I the fire-giving herb; the mantram I; I also the butter; I the fire; the burnt-offering I;","en2":"I am the Kratu, I the Yajna, I the Svadhâ, I the Aushadham, I the Mantra, I the Ajyam, I the fire, and I the oblation.","en2r":null,"rv":null,"kid":null},{"v":17,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"पिताऽहमस्य जगतो माता धाता पितामहः ।\nवेद्यं पवित्रमोंकार ऋक् साम यजुरेव च ॥","iast":"pitā’hamasya jagato mātā dhātā pitāmahaḥ |\nvedyaṃ pavitramoṃkāra ṛk sāma yajureva ca ||","read":"pitaa'hamasya jagato maataa dhaataa pitaamahah |\nvedyam pavitramomkaara rik saama yajureva cha ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"I the Father of this universe, the Mother, the Supporter, the Grandsire, the Holy one to be known, the Word of Power, and also the Rik, Sâma, and Yajur,","en2":"I am the Father of this world, the Mother, the Sustainer, the Grandfather; the Purifier, the (one) thing to be known, (the syllable) Om, and also the Rik, Sâman and Yajus.","en2r":null,"rv":null,"kid":null},{"v":18,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"गतिर्भर्ता प्रभुः साक्षी निवासः शरणं सुहृत् ।\nप्रभवः प्रलयः स्थानं निधानं बीजमव्ययम् ॥","iast":"gatirbhartā prabhuḥ sākṣī nivāsaḥ śaraṇaṃ suhṛt |\nprabhavaḥ pralayaḥ sthānaṃ nidhānaṃ bījamavyayam ||","read":"gatirbhartaa prabhuh saakshee nivaasah sharanam suhrit |\nprabhavah pralayah sthaanam nidhaanam beejamavyayam ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"The Path, Husband, Lord, Witness, Abode, Shelter, Lover, Origin, Dissolution, Foundation, house, Seed imperishable.","en2":"The Goal, the Supporter, the Lord, the Witness, the Abode, the Refuge, the Friend, the Origin, the Dissolution, the Substratum, the Storehouse, the Seed immutable.","en2r":null,"rv":null,"kid":null},{"v":19,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"तपाम्यहमहं वर्षं निगृह्णाम्युत्सृजामि च ।\nअमृतं चैव मृत्युश्च सदसच्चाहमर्जुन ॥","iast":"tapāmyahamahaṃ varṣaṃ nigṛhṇāmyutsṛjāmi ca |\namṛtaṃ caiva mṛtyuśca sadasaccāhamarjuna ||","read":"tapaamyahamaham varsham nigrihnaamyutsrijaami cha |\namritam chaiva mrityushcha sadasachchaahamarjuna ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"I give heat; I hold back and send forth the rain; immortality and also death, being and non-being am I, Arjuna.","en2":"(As sun) I give heat: I withhold and send forth rain; I am immortality and also death; being and non-being am I, O Arjuna!","en2r":null,"rv":null,"kid":null},{"v":20,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"त्रैविद्या मां सोमपाः पूतपापा ।\nयज्ञैरिष्ट्वा स्वर्गतिं प्रार्थयन्ते ।\nते पुण्यमासाद्य सुरेन्द्रलोक ।\nमश्नन्ति दिव्यान्दिवि देवभोगान् ॥","iast":"traividyā māṃ somapāḥ pūtapāpā |\nyajñairiṣṭvā svargatiṃ prārthayante |\nte puṇyamāsādya surendraloka |\nmaśnanti divyāndivi devabhogān ||","read":"traividyaa maam somapaah pootapaapaa |\nyajnairishtvaa svargatim praarthayante |\nte punyamaasaadya surendraloka |\nmashnanti divyaandivi devabhogaan ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"The knowers of the three, the Soma-drinkers, the purified from sin, worshipping Me with sacrifice, pray of Me the way to heaven; they, ascending to the holy world of the Ruler of the Shining Ones, eat in heaven the divine feasts of the Shining Ones.","en2":"The knowers of the three Vedas, worshipping Me by Yajna, drinking the Soma, and (thus) being purified from sin, pray for passage to heaven; reaching the holy world of the Lord of the Devas, they enjoy in heaven the divine pleasures of the Devas.","en2r":null,"rv":null,"kid":null},{"v":21,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"ते तं भुक्त्वा स्वर्गलोकं विशालं ।\nक्षीणे पुण्ये मर्त्यलोकं विशन्ति ।\nएवं त्रयीधर्ममनुप्रपन्ना ।\nगतागतं कामकामा लभन्ते ॥","iast":"te taṃ bhuktvā svargalokaṃ viśālaṃ |\nkṣīṇe puṇye martyalokaṃ viśanti |\nevaṃ trayīdharmamanuprapannā |\ngatāgataṃ kāmakāmā labhante ||","read":"te tam bhuktvaa svargalokam vishaalam |\nksheene punye martyalokam vishanti |\nevam trayeedharmamanuprapannaa |\ngataagatam kaamakaamaa labhante ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"They, having enjoyed the spacious heaven-world, their holiness withered, come back to this world of death. Following the virtues enjoined by the three, desiring desires, they obtain the transitory.","en2":"Having enjoyed the vast Swarga-world, they enter the mortal world, on the exhaustion of their merit: Thus, abiding by the injunctions of the three (Vedas), desiring desires, they (constantly) come and go.","en2r":null,"rv":null,"kid":null},{"v":22,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"अनन्याश्चिन्तयन्तो मां ये जनाः पर्युपासते ।\nतेषां नित्याभियुक्तानां योगक्षेमं वहाम्यहम् ॥","iast":"ananyāścintayanto māṃ ye janāḥ paryupāsate |\nteṣāṃ nityābhiyuktānāṃ yogakṣemaṃ vahāmyaham ||","read":"ananyaashchintayanto maam ye janaah paryupaasate |\nteshaam nityaabhiyuktaanaam yogakshemam vahaamyaham ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"To those men who worship Me alone thinking of no other, to those ever harmonious, I bring full security.","en2":"Persons who, meditating on Me as non-separate, worship Me in all beings, to them thus ever jealously engaged, I carry what they lack and preserve what they already have.","en2r":null,"rv":null,"kid":null},{"v":23,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"येऽप्यन्यदेवता भक्ता यजन्ते श्रद्धयाऽन्विताः ।\nतेऽपि मामेव कौन्तेय यजन्त्यविधिपूर्वकम् ॥","iast":"ye’pyanyadevatā bhaktā yajante śraddhayā’nvitāḥ |\nte’pi māmeva kaunteya yajantyavidhipūrvakam ||","read":"ye'pyanyadevataa bhaktaa yajante shraddhayaa'nvitaah |\nte'pi maameva kaunteya yajantyavidhipoorvakam ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Even the devotees of other Shining Ones, who worship full of faith, they also worship Me, O son of Kuntî, though contrary to the ancient rule.","en2":"Even those devotees, who endued with Shraddhâ, worship other gods, they too worship Me alone, O son of Kunti, (but) by the wrong method.","en2r":null,"rv":null,"kid":null},{"v":24,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"अहं हि सर्वयज्ञानां भोक्ता च प्रभुरेव च ।\nन तु मामभिजानन्ति तत्त्वेनातश्च्यवन्ति ते ॥","iast":"ahaṃ hi sarvayajñānāṃ bhoktā ca prabhureva ca |\nna tu māmabhijānanti tattvenātaścyavanti te ||","read":"aham hi sarvayajnaanaam bhoktaa cha prabhureva cha |\nna tu maamabhijaananti tattvenaatashchyavanti te ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"I am indeed the enjoyer of all sacrifices and also the Lord, but they know Me not in Essence, and hence they fall.","en2":"For I alone am the Enjoyer, and Lord of all Yajnas; but because they do not know Me in reality, they return, (to the mortal world).","en2r":null,"rv":null,"kid":null},{"v":25,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"यान्ति देवव्रता देवान् पितॄन्यान्ति पितृव्रताः ।\nभूतानि यान्ति भूतेज्या यान्ति मद्याजिनोऽपि माम् ॥","iast":"yānti devavratā devān pitṝnyānti pitṛvratāḥ |\nbhūtāni yānti bhūtejyā yānti madyājino’pi mām ||","read":"yaanti devavrataa devaan pitreenyaanti pitrivrataah |\nbhootaani yaanti bhootejyaa yaanti madyaajino'pi maam ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"They who worship the Shining Ones go to the Shining Ones; to the Ancestors go the Ancestor-worshippers; to the Elements go those who sacrifice to Elementals; but My worshippers come unto Me.","en2":"Votaries of the Devas go to the Devas; to the Pitris, go their votaries; to the Bhutas, go the Bhuta worshippers; My votaries too come unto Me.","en2r":null,"rv":null,"kid":null},{"v":26,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"पत्रं पुष्पं फलं तोयं यो मे भक्त्या प्रयच्छति ।\nतदहं भक्त्युपहृतमश्नामि प्रयतात्मनः ॥","iast":"patraṃ puṣpaṃ phalaṃ toyaṃ yo me bhaktyā prayacchati |\ntadahaṃ bhaktyupahṛtamaśnāmi prayatātmanaḥ ||","read":"patram pushpam phalam toyam yo me bhaktyaa prayachchhati |\ntadaham bhaktyupahritamashnaami prayataatmanah ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"He who offereth to Me with devotion a leaf, a flower, a fruit, water, that I accept from the striving self, offered as it is with devotion.","en2":"Whoever with devotion offers Me a leaf, a flower, a fruit, or water, that I accept—the devout gift of the pure-minded.","en2r":null,"rv":null,"kid":null},{"v":27,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"यत्करोषि यदश्नासि यज्जुहोषि ददासि यत् ।\nयत्तपस्यसि कौन्तेय तत्कुरुष्व मदर्पणम् ॥","iast":"yatkaroṣi yadaśnāsi yajjuhoṣi dadāsi yat |\nyattapasyasi kaunteya tatkuruṣva madarpaṇam ||","read":"yatkaroshi yadashnaasi yajjuhoshi dadaasi yat |\nyattapasyasi kaunteya tatkurushva madarpanam ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Whatsoever thou doest, whatsoever thou eatest, whatsoever thou offerest, whatsoever thou givest, whatsoever thou doest of austerity, O Kaunteya, do thou that as an offering unto Me.","en2":"Whatever thou doest, whatever thou eatest, whatever thou offerest in sacrifice, whatever thou givest away, whatever austerity thou practisest, O son of Kunti, do that as an offering unto Me.","en2r":null,"rv":null,"kid":null},{"v":28,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"शुभाशुभफलैरेवं मोक्ष्यसे कर्मबन्धनैः ।\nसंन्यासयोगयुक्तात्मा विमुक्तो मामुपैष्यसि ॥","iast":"śubhāśubhaphalairevaṃ mokṣyase karmabandhanaiḥ |\nsaṃnyāsayogayuktātmā vimukto māmupaiṣyasi ||","read":"shubhaashubhaphalairevam mokshyase karmabandhanaih |\nsamnyaasayogayuktaatmaa vimukto maamupaishyasi ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Thus shalt thou be liberated from the bonds of action, yielding good and evil fruits; thyself harmonised by the yoga of renunciation, thou shalt come unto Me when set free.","en2":"Thus shalt thou be freed from the bondages of actions, bearing good and evil results: with the heart steadfast in the Yoga of renunciation, and liberated, thou shalt come unto Me.","en2r":null,"rv":null,"kid":null},{"v":29,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"समोऽहं सर्वभूतेषु न मे द्वेष्योऽस्ति न प्रियः ।\nये भजन्ति तु मां भक्त्या मयि ते तेषु चाप्यहम् ॥","iast":"samo’haṃ sarvabhūteṣu na me dveṣyo’sti na priyaḥ |\nye bhajanti tu māṃ bhaktyā mayi te teṣu cāpyaham ||","read":"samo'ham sarvabhooteshu na me dveshyo'sti na priyah |\nye bhajanti tu maam bhaktyaa mayi te teshu chaapyaham ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"The same am I to all beings; there is none hateful to Me nor dear. They verily who worship Me with devotion, they are in Me, and I also in them.","en2":"I am the same to all beings: to Me there is none hateful or dear. But those who worship Me with devotion, are in Me, and I too am in them.","en2r":null,"rv":null,"kid":null},{"v":30,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"अपि चेत्सुदुराचारो भजते मामनन्यभाक् ।\nसाधुरेव स मन्तव्यः सम्यग्व्यवसितो हि सः ॥","iast":"api cetsudurācāro bhajate māmananyabhāk |\nsādhureva sa mantavyaḥ samyagvyavasito hi saḥ ||","read":"api chetsuduraachaaro bhajate maamananyabhaak |\nsaadhureva sa mantavyah samyagvyavasito hi sah ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Even if the most sinful worship Me, with un divided heart, he too must be accounted righteous, for he hath rightly resolved;","en2":"If even a very wicked person worships Me, with devotion to none else, he should be regarded as good, for he has rightly resolved.","en2r":null,"rv":null,"kid":null},{"v":31,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"क्षिप्रं भवति धर्मात्मा शश्वच्छान्तिं निगच्छति ।\nकौन्तेय प्रतिजानीहि न मे भक्तः प्रणश्यति ॥","iast":"kṣipraṃ bhavati dharmātmā śaśvacchāntiṃ nigacchati |\nkaunteya pratijānīhi na me bhaktaḥ praṇaśyati ||","read":"kshipram bhavati dharmaatmaa shashvachchhaantim nigachchhati |\nkaunteya pratijaaneehi na me bhaktah pranashyati ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Speedily he becometh dutiful and goeth to eternal peace; O Kaunteya, know thou for certain that My devotee perisheth never.","en2":"Soon does he become righteous, and attain eternal Peace, O son of Kunti boldly canst thou proclaim, that My devotee is never destroyed.","en2r":null,"rv":null,"kid":null},{"v":32,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"मां हि पार्थ व्यपाश्रित्य येऽपि स्युः पापयोनयः ।\nस्त्रियो वैश्यास्तथा शूद्रास्तेऽपि यान्ति परां गतिम् ॥","iast":"māṃ hi pārtha vyapāśritya ye’pi syuḥ pāpayonayaḥ |\nstriyo vaiśyāstathā śūdrāste’pi yānti parāṃ gatim ||","read":"maam hi paartha vyapaashritya ye'pi syuh paapayonayah |\nstriyo vaishyaastathaa shoodraaste'pi yaanti paraam gatim ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"They who take refuge with Me, O Partha, though of the womb of sin, women, Vaishyas, even Shûdras, they also tread the highest path.","en2":"For, taking refuge in Me, they also, O son of Prithâ, who might be of inferior birth,—women, Vaishyas, as well as Sudras,—even they attain to the Supreme Goal.","en2r":null,"rv":null,"kid":null},{"v":33,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"किं पुनर्ब्राह्मणाः पुण्या भक्ता राजर्षयस्तथा ।\nअनित्यमसुखं लोकमिमं प्राप्य भजस्व माम् ॥","iast":"kiṃ punarbrāhmaṇāḥ puṇyā bhaktā rājarṣayastathā |\nanityamasukhaṃ lokamimaṃ prāpya bhajasva mām ||","read":"kim punarbraahmanaah punyaa bhaktaa raajarshayastathaa |\nanityamasukham lokamimam praapya bhajasva maam ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"How much rather then holy Brâhmanas and devoted royal saints; having obtained this transient joyless world, worship thou Me.","en2":"What need to mention holy Brâhmanas, and devoted Râjarshis! Having obtained this transient, joyless world, worship thou Me.","en2r":null,"rv":null,"kid":null},{"v":34,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"मन्मना भव मद्भक्तो मद्याजी मां नमस्कुरु ।\nमामेवैष्यसि युक्त्वैवमात्मानं मत्परायणः ॥","iast":"manmanā bhava madbhakto madyājī māṃ namaskuru |\nmāmevaiṣyasi yuktvaivamātmānaṃ matparāyaṇaḥ ||","read":"manmanaa bhava madbhakto madyaajee maam namaskuru |\nmaamevaishyasi yuktvaivamaatmaanam matparaayanah ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"On Me fix thy mind, be devoted to Me; sacrifice to Me; prostrate thyself before Me; harmonised thus in the Self, thou shalt come unto Me, having Me as thy supreme goal.","en2":"Fill thy mind with Me, be My devotee, sacrifice unto Me, bow down to Me; thus having made thy heart steadfast in Me, taking Me as the Supreme Goal, thou shalt come to Me.","en2r":null,"rv":null,"kid":null}];
